  "question": {
    "text": "The equation of a plane containing the line formed by&nbsp;<math><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math> <math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;and at a distance of <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math> units from the point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2,1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is"
