  "solution": {
    "text": "Equation of the required plane is<br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Distance of the plane from <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2,1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>λ</mi></mrow><msqrt><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math><br /><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>11</mn><msup><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mn>6</mn><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><msup><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>24</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math><br />Hence, the equation of the plane is<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>62</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>29</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>19</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>105</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>"
